{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"5165","title":"POCO Introduces POCO F7: Where Futuristic Design Meets Exceptional Power","desc":"POCO, a leading technology brand among young tech enthusiasts, today unveiled POCO F7, setting a new benchmark for flagship performance in its category. ","view_cnt":"8052","like_cnt":"1","add_time":"1750667232","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i02.appmifile.com/899_operatorx_operatorx_opx/23/06/2025/9fd7626f41970d104931890696936640.jpg"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eBeijing, China, June 24th, 2025\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e – POCO, a leading technology brand among young tech enthusiasts, today unveiled POCO F7, setting a new benchmark for flagship performance in its category. As POCO deepens its collaboration with Qualcomm Technologies, Inc., POCO F7 is powered by the recently debuted Snapdragon\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: MiSans Latin, sans-serif\"\u003e® \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e8s Gen 4 Mobile Platform, bringing flagship-level power and efficiency to more users. Introducing a bold new look to mark this evolution, POCO F7 Cyber Silver Edition features a Snapdragon\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: MiSans Latin, sans-serif\"\u003e® \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003elogo on the back, symbolizing the fusion of explosive performance with expressive design. The launch is also highlighted by the debut of Rydr, POCO's first-ever virtual avatar. Embodying speed, power, and intelligent action, Rydr reflects POCO's ongoing pursuit of breakthrough performance and deeper engagement with the tech-savvy generation.\u003c/span\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\"With POCO F7, we're advancing our commitment to redefine flagship performance by making it accessible to a wider audience. The launch of POCO F7 Cyber Silver Edition - with its distinctive aesthetic - further embodies our vision to connect more deeply with a new generation by blending futuristic style and powerful technology,\" said Angus Ng, Head of Product Marketing at POCO Global.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eFlagship Power, Intelligent Performance\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eAt the core of POCO F7 is the recently debuted Snapdragon\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: MiSans Latin, sans-serif\"\u003e®\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e 8s Gen 4 Mobile Platform, built on an all-big-core CPU architecture that enables faster, more efficient processing. With an AnTuTu benchmark score of 2,084,535¹, it achieves over 30% performance improvement² over the previous generation.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/956_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/23/06/2025/a664d2dfa4a154ac139b5ec19e72c2c8.jpg\" alt=\"A Snapdragon 8s Gen 4 chip, installed on the circuit board of modern electronic devices, with a background of intricate circuit design.\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eTo keep this power stable under pressure, POCO F7 features the brand's most advanced and effective cooling system yet: a 6000mm² 3D Dual-Channel IceLoop System with the biggest Loop Heat Pipe ever used in a POCO device. Supporting this is a 6500mAh (typ) battery - the largest in the POCO F Series. Paired with 90W HyperCharge³, which charges the battery to 80% in just 30 minutes⁴, it delivers extended screen time with minimal downtime. For added convenience, POCO F7 supports 22.5W reverse charging⁵, offering broad compatibility across Xiaomi and other major smartphone brands.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/114_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/23/06/2025/b6e603947a457cf5197bcca0541d5a93.jpg\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eTranslating performance into real-world responsiveness, POCO F7 runs on Xiaomi HyperOS 2⁶. On the gaming front, WildBoost Optimization 4.0 brings further gaming enhancements with support for 1.5K Super Resolution and Smart Frame Rate for up to 120FPS in Genshin Impact. Completing the flagship experience is the Surge T1s signal tuner, which enhances cellular performance and boosts Wi-Fi and Bluetooth stability to keep the device reliably connected.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/603_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/23/06/2025/315d11c6185364b8b5d47ff5ff899e8d.jpg\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eUltra-Bright, Ultra-Big Display Built to Keep Up\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eTo match its flagship-level performance, POCO F7 features a 6.83-inch 1.5K ultra-bright display that strikes the ideal balance between visual impact and everyday usability. With high brightness, precise touch response, and advanced eye comfort features, it delivers flagship-level clarity, comfort, and control.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/529_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/23/06/2025/acea7da4cd169abd6d55895cb64fbd0f.jpg\" alt=\"A smartphone is placed flat on a gray background, with the screen displaying dark and reflective patterns. The phone's frame is silver, and the overall design is minimalist.\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eFor clear visibility even in harsh light, the display reaches 3200 nits peak brightness and covers up to 25% APL, enhancing brightness across a larger screen area without being limited to HDR or SDR content. This is further supported by POCO's Sunlight Display 4.0, which enhances contrast in real time for vivid, accurate visuals.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/190_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/23/06/2025/c7173e189b0181939aa892d192a9e941.jpg\" alt=\"A person wearing a bright green jacket is tapping on the phone screen with their finger, with a gray wall in the background, and the phone displays the time and date.\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eBuilt with both comfort and precision in mind, POCO F7 is equipped with TÜV Rheinland Low Blue Light (Hardware Solution) Certification, TÜV Rheinland Flicker Free Certification, and TÜV Rheinland Circadian Friendly Certification, reducing eye strain even during extended sessions. Paired with 3840Hz PWM dimming, Wet Touch Display 2.0, and an ultra-responsive 2560Hz⁷ instant touch sampling rate, the screen adjusts seamlessly across different use scenarios, whether navigating with damp fingers or responding to fast-paced gaming.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/502_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/23/06/2025/8e0922f385d125d9a92f4c5fc22bf7d1.jpg\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eDesign That Moves, Build That Lasts\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eIntroducing an all-new design language inspired by speed, POCO F7 channels motion into form while staying grounded in durability. The device features a streamlined surface, a sleek CNC-integrated aluminum alloy frame, and a glass back cover that together create a modern, dynamic look.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eAt the front, minimal bezels frame the display, achieving a 94.23% screen-to-body ratio², adding to the sense of immersion and visual flow. Complementing this, large-radius curves enhance ergonomics, offering a smooth and comfortable grip. Around the back, a blade-like neon flare camera deco embodies precision and a sense of motion, while a golden-angle tangent line divides the panel for a more balanced, harmonious look.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eBlending geometric accents with a futuristic edge, POCO F7 Cyber Silver Edition makes a bold statement. Inspired by the Cyber aesthetic, its mechanical-style overlay and prominent Snapdragon\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: MiSans Latin, sans-serif\"\u003e® \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003elogo above the division embody the raw power driving the device.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/713_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/23/06/2025/07af9b7e81e9c9b5ace6d519eaab7a0f.jpg\" alt=\"Three models of POCO phones are displayed side by side, in black, white, and silver. The black and white phones have a minimalist design on the back, while the silver phone features a unique design. The front display shows a smooth curve.\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eBeyond appearance, POCO F7 is engineered to endure. The reinforced structure offers bending resistance rated up to 70kg², reducing impact from accidental pressure. Combined with IP68 dust and water resistance⁸, it's built to remain dependable across unpredictable environments.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/527_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/23/06/2025/5fddfd86dce145abcb4c71f3eef42eef.jpg\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003ePro‑Level Photography, Effortless Creativity\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eWhether it's fast-paced action or a carefully crafted shot, POCO F7 is equipped with a camera system designed to capture moments with clarity and elevate them effortlessly.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eAt the heart of it is a 50MP Sony IMX882 main camera with OIS, delivering high-quality images across diverse lighting conditions. Features like UltraSnap and Live Photo further elevate the shooting experience with speed, depth, and motion. When it comes to portrait photography, POCO F7 offers versatile 26mm, 35mm, and 52mm focal lengths, coupled with real light spot feature that gives your background a soft, beautiful blur.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/279_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/23/06/2025/2c0038bf3d3b25a0c7a9a06447630f0e.jpg\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eMeanwhile, the new AI function - AI Beautify further enhances image quality by refining tone, clarity, contrast, and brightness levels, bringing out rich detail across all scenes without overprocessing. To support the improved camera experience, the camera interface has also been redesigned for clearer navigation and a smarter user experience.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/517_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/23/06/2025/3137cd05c3502de8e003c494eb07a8e3.jpg\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eProduct availability\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003ePOCO F7 is available in three colors: Black, White, Silver.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eIt will be available in two variants: 12GB+256GB, and 12GB+512GB.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e*Availability may vary by countries/regions, you may consult third party shopping websites for more purchasing options.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e*Available storage and RAM are less than the total memory due to storage of the operating system and software pre-installed on the device.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003ePrice and availability vary between markets and sales channels. Please refer to \u003c/span\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://mi.com\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003emi.com\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e for product availability and detailed regional sales information.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e¹ Data tested based on AnTuTu v10.4.9 by POCO Internal Labs. Actual results may vary.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e² Data tested by POCO Internal Labs, actual results may vary.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e³ 90W HyperCharge means the adapter output power is 90W. Actual power output may vary depending on the environment. Availability may vary by countries/regions, you may consult our online store or third party shopping websites for more purchasing options.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e⁴ Data is obtained from POCO Internal Labs with a test room temperature of approximately 25℃. Actual results may vary due to different test environments. Please refer to actual experience.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e⁵ Supports up to 22.5W wired reverse charging, compatible with devices verified through POCO labs testing. \u003cbr\u003e⁶ Availability of Xiaomi HyperOS 2 features, apps and services may vary depending on region, software version and phone model.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e⁷ 2560Hz instant touch sampling rate is activated under Game Turbo Mode.\u003cbr\u003e⁸ The device is certified to be water and dust resistant exclusively under specific laboratory conditions not corresponding to normal use conditions. The warranty does not cover liquid damage caused by conditions other than test conditions. Ingress protection might deteriorate due to wear and tear, physical damage and/or disassembly needed for repair. Please visit official website for more information.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eAbout POCO\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003ePOCO is a young independent brand born out of Xiaomi Corporation. As of now, POCO has entered 98 global markets. The POCO philosophy – \"Everything You Need, Nothing You Don't\" – drives the brand to focus its research and development efforts entirely on POCO fans' requirements and feedback. This relentless pursuit of technology that its fans truly need democratizes decision-making to accelerate the company's evolution and refresh the smartphone industry.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"1407","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1750768222"},"common":null}